00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:10.480
What's the difference between a cat and a compound sentence?

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:12.260
One has claws at the end of its paws,

00:00:12.260 --> 00:00:14.060
one has a pause at the end of its clause.

00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:16.140
How about the difference between a tuna and a piano?

00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:17.560
You can tune a piano, but

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:19.140
you cannot piano a tuna.

00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:21.560
The difference between the moon and Julius Caesar?

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:23.660
The moon is rocky and full of craters,

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:25.140
and Julius Caesar is dead.

00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:28.320
